{"availability":"available","full":"Kedata-Indonesia/docflow","name":"docflow","description":"Open-source rich text editor with true page layout (A4/A5, page breaks) and real-time collaboration. TipTap/ProseMirror + Vue 3 + Yjs. Apache-2.0.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":10,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-23T13:33:42Z","updated":"2026-10-15T13:26:47Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://docflow.kedata.cloud","topics":["collaboration","editor","pagination","prosemirror","tiptap","typescript","vue3","yjs"],"demo":"https://docflow-app.kedata.cloud/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:36.238Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:36.238Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:36.238Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:50.734Z","stars":5,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:35.240Z","stars":7,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:36.238Z","stars":10,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The open-source editor engine for document-style apps — true A4 pagination, real-time collaboration, and layout-aware AI. The libraries are free to embed under Apache-2.0; the deployable application and the Cloud platform are licensed.","Built on TipTap / ProseMirror with a page pagination engine and Yjs-based collaboration.","This repository holds the library packages only. The deployable application (web UI + API server) is proprietary and is not published here — see the live demo."],"features":["True page layout — auto page-breaks, headers/footers with {page}/{total}, A4/Letter/Legal. TipTap offers this only via the paid Pages Pro extension; CKEditor gates it behind a premium plugin; OnlyOffice is heavyweight…","Apache-2.0 license — the libraries are safe for commercial embedding and self-hosting, with no copyleft anxiety and no premium gates on the core. The core stays Apache-2.0 forever.","Real-time collaboration built in — Yjs CRDT out of the box, self-hosta